Daryl, ayo! Daryl!

00:43:17.489 --> 00:43:19.013
Cepat!

00:43:19.038 --> 00:43:20.996
Mundur!

00:43:49.000 --> 00:43:49.800
Justina, maafkan aku! Maafkan aku!

00:43:50.500 --> 00:43:52.285
- Daryl!
- Jangan biarkan kami pergi!

00:43:53.489 --> 00:43:55.448
Daryl! Kumohon! Jangan!

